kind: llman.sdd.delta
ops[1]{op,req_id,title,statement,from,to,name}:
  modify_requirement,dl1,"debug-observation-pipeline","应用 MUST 在组合根（app::cli::run，CliArgs::parse 之后、模式分发之前）恰好一次装配 file-only 观测后端：fastrace Reporter 与 log 文件日志均 MUST 只写入 agent 日志目录下的文件（如 xylitol.log / provider-trace.jsonl），MUST NEVER 写 stdout 或 stderr，以免破坏 TUI Inline viewport 与 DSR。禁止使用会打印到 stderr 的 ConsoleReporter。激活 MUST 仅由环境与构建配置驱动（无 CLI flag、无 settings 字段）：debug 构建（cfg(debug_assertions)）MUST 默认启用；release MUST 默认关闭，经 XYLITOL_DEBUG / RUST_LOG（级别日志）与 XYLITOL_PROVIDER_TRACE（provider timeline）显式打开。文件写入 MUST 同步 append（兼容 panic=abort），unix 下文件模式 MUST 为 0o600。TUI 层 MUST 只调用 log 宏或 fastrace API，MUST NOT 自行安装 Reporter。时间线栈 MUST 为 fastrace；MUST NOT 再依赖 tracing / tracing-subscriber。","The application MUST activate a tracing subscriber that writes ONLY to a file (~/.xylitol/logs/xylitol.log), NEVER to stdout or stderr, so that TUI rendering (Viewport::Inline + raw mode + per-frame DSR cursor query) is never corrupted by log output. The subscriber MUST be installed exactly once at the composition root (app::cli::run, right after CliArgs::parse and before any mode dispatch), covering all app surfaces (print, TUI, RPC, subcommands). Activation MUST be environment-driven only with no CLI flag and no settings field: when RUST_LOG is set the subscriber installs with EnvFilter::try_from_default_env(); else when XYLITOL_DEBUG=1 it installs with a default filter; otherwise NO subscriber is installed and all tracing macros are no-op with zero overhead. The file writer MUST be synchronous (std::fs::OpenOptions append, NOT tracing-appender non_blocking) so that panic=abort cannot drop buffered log lines, and the file MUST be created with mode 0o600 on unix. The writer MUST disable ANSI (with_ansi(false)). Existing tracing emit sites in infra/ and agent/ MUST become observable automatically without code changes to those layers. The TUI layer MUST only call tracing:: macros (e.g. tracing::debug!) and MUST NOT import infra or install any subscriber (layering invariant). Evidence: tracing 0.1.44 is already an unconditional dependency and ~12 tracing::warn!/info!/debug! call sites already exist across infra (event, permission, mcp, settings, hooks) and agent (compaction), but no tracing_subscriber init and no RUST_LOG reference exist anywhere in the repo, so these emits are entirely silent today; the TUI layer has zero tracing calls.",null,null
op_scenarios[3]{req_id,id,given,when,then}:
  dl1,"file-only-never-stdout-stderr","debug 构建或已显式打开观测且 TUI 活跃","任意层发出 log::debug 或 fastrace Event","内容写入日志目录文件且 stdout/stderr 无污染"
  dl1,"debug-default-on","cfg(debug_assertions) 且未强制关闭","启动应用","file-only Reporter/logger 已装配"
  dl1,"release-needs-opt-in","release 且未设 XYLITOL_DEBUG / XYLITOL_PROVIDER_TRACE / 等价 RUST_LOG","启动应用","不安装会落盘的观测后端（或等价零写入）"
